2. Minecraft textures
---------------------

  assets/hellstorm/textures/block/hellfire_upgrader.png

    This texture sheet contains unmodified copies of Minecraft's
    block/stone.png and block/enchanting_table_top.png, and cut pieces of the
    enchanting table textures. Those parts are Mojang's work. The whole file is
    excluded from Hellstorm's license (see LICENSE) and is used under Mojang's
    terms: the Minecraft EULA and the Minecraft Usage Guidelines.

  assets/hellstorm/textures/block/mystery_crate.png

    This texture sheet is built from Minecraft's block/oak_planks.png: its
    plank pattern, darkened to look charred, with ember pixels added. The
    plank pattern is Mojang's work. The whole file is excluded from
    Hellstorm's license (see LICENSE) and is used under Mojang's terms: the
    Minecraft EULA and the Minecraft Usage Guidelines.

  Models that only point at minecraft: textures (oak planks, iron block,
  redstone lamp, and so on) contain no Mojang pixels; the game loads those
  textures from its own files.


