4. Code adapted from others
---------------------------

  client/outline/Outlines.java is ported from the Outliner in Catnip, as
  compiled into Ponder 1.0.92 (net.createmod.ponder:Ponder-Forge-1.20.1): how
  outlines are kept, fade, and are drawn as thin boxes, and how a block
  cluster's edges are found. Earlier versions of Hellstorm bundled Ponder (and
  Flywheel, which it needs); they no longer do.
    Copyright (c) 2022 The Create Team. MIT License, text A below.


5. Not bundled
---------------

  TacZ (Timeless and Classics Zero) is a separate, required mod. Its code is
